    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutally Difficult Score Attack Breakout/Pinball type videogame with Sensory Overload and a Totally Awesome Soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must keep track of the Crazy Brain using their highly perceptive skills and high functioning cognition while attempting to Gather points and collect an\u00a0 accumulated score and attempting to exit stage before failing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 Unique Stages </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Large Tower Stage </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four Modes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Consecutive Mode  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Marathon Mode  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Tower Mode  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Solo Stage Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>   <br>\u00a0Learn when to boost and when not to boost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate Score without failing.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crazy Brain must enter the goal to collect score.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOW TO PLAY:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. When the Crazy Brain enters the goal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the stage run finishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >try not to enter the goal too soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hold back and take risks for more points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Press the &quot;space bar&quot; to charge </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the VHS TAPE paddle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to multiply your potential score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the charge only lasts for a split second,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so timing is required to achieve this.<br><br>3. Use Left Flipper with &quot;S&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use RIGHT Flipper with &quot;ENTER&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the Position of each flipper Strategically </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by Rapidly Pressing &quot;S&quot; or &quot;ENTER&quot;.<br><br>4. Move the VHS tape paddle with &quot;a&quot; or &quot;d&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to rebound the Crazy Brain,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >block Crazy Brain, or</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >get out of the way of the Crazy Brain.<br><br>5. Press &quot;P&quot; at your own risk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to multiply your potential score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pressing &quot;p&quot; causes both Crazy Brain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > to pick up speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rapidly.<br><br>6. Pressing &quot;p&quot; can be used</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when a Crazy Brain is stagnant or too slow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Pressing &quot;p&quot; strategically is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
