th &quot;a&quot; or &quot;d&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to rebound the Crazy Brain,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >block Crazy Brain, or</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >get out of the way of the Crazy Brain.<br><br>5. Press &quot;P&quot; at your own risk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to multiply your potential score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pressing &quot;p&quot; causes both Crazy Brain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > to pick up speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rapidly.<br><br>6. Pressing &quot;p&quot; can be used</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when a Crazy Brain is stagnant or too slow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Pressing &quot;p&quot; strategically is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
